<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`reconcileOrphans` writes each orphan slot record as a plain record file under `<root-stem>.orphans/`, raises the root's orphan flag, and gives the folder back once the root returns. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

